OL,3,CSuspended chief constable resigns day
OL,4,Cbefore misconduct hearing
OL,6,FThe chief constable of Staffordshire
OL,7,FPolice has resigned from the top job
OL,8,Fthe day before a misconduct hearing.
OL,10,FChristopher Noble, who was appointed
OL,11,Fto the job in December 2021, was
OL,12,Fsuspended in August last year by
OL,13,FStaffordshire commissioner for police,
OL,14,Ffire and rescue and crime, Ben Adams.
OL,16,FThe suspension came amid an
OL,17,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,18,Finvestigation into allegations about
OL,19,Fhis conduct.
