OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785410316
OL,3,CSuspended chief constable resigns day
OL,4,Cbefore misconduct hearing
OL,6,FMr Noble is the subject of a gross
OL,7,Fmisconduct hearing that started on
OL,8,FWednesday at Yarnfield Park in
OL,9,FStaffordshire.
OL,11,FHe resigned from the Chief Constable
OL,12,Frole on Tuesday, the day before the
OL,13,Fhearing commenced, in a letter to Mr
OL,14,FAdams.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
