PN,34403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785410316
OL,3,CSuspended chief constable resigns day
OL,4,Cbefore misconduct hearing
OL,6,FIn a statement Staffordshire
OL,7,FCommissioner for Police, Fire & Rescue
OL,8,Fand Crime Ben Adams said: "I can
OL,9,Fconfirm that yesterday (28 July), I
OL,10,Freceived Chief Constable Chris Noble's
OL,11,Fresignation, which I have accepted
OL,12,Fwith immediate effect.
OL,14,F"Becky Riggs will remain as
OL,15,FStaffordshire Police's Acting Chief
OL,16,FConstable.
OL,18,F"The misconduct hearing is continuing
OL,19,Ftoday as planned, under former officer
OL,20,Fprovisions."
